<LanguageData>
  <!--原中文: '法力空虚', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'arcane weakness',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: arcane weakness-->
  <TM_ArcaneWeakness.label>法力空虚</TM_ArcaneWeakness.label>
  <!--原中文: '法力空虚是施法魔法的副作用。法力值低于25的次要魔法不会产生法力空虚。影响法师的法力空虚严重性与该技能的法力消耗有关.', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Arcane Weakness is a byproduct of casting magical abilities. Minor abilities with a mana cost less than 25 will not incur Arcane Weakness. The amount of Arcane Weakness that will affect a mage is relative to the mana cost of the ability.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Arcane Weakness is a byproduct of casting magical abilities. Minor abilities with a mana cost less than 25 will not incur Arcane Weakness. The amount of Arcane Weakness that will affect a mage is relative to the mana cost of the ability.-->
  <TM_ArcaneWeakness.description>法力空虚是施法魔法的副作用。法力值低于25的次要魔法不会产生法力空虚。影响法师的法力空虚严重性与该技能的法力消耗有关.</TM_ArcaneWeakness.description>
  <!--原中文: '虚弱', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'weakened',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: weakened-->
  <TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.0.label>虚弱</TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.0.label>
  <!--原中文: '严重', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'drained',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: drained-->
  <TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.1.label>严重</TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.1.label>
