  <!--EN: catatonic-->
  <TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.3.label>无法行动</TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.3.label>
  <!--原中文: '濒临死亡', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'near death',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: near death-->
  <TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.4.label>濒临死亡</TM_ArcaneWeakness.stages.4.label>
  <!--原中文: '奥术诅咒', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'arcane curse',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: arcane curse-->
  <TM_CursedHD.label>奥术诅咒</TM_CursedHD.label>
  <!--原中文: '奥术诅咒是受诅咒者特性的产物。 被诅咒的人不断受到奥术弱点的影响，这种弱点会逐渐增加，直到它成为一种持续的疾病。 诅咒的效果可以通过使用魔法来抵消，然而，诅咒造成的痛苦确实提供了一个独特的意识加成。没有魔法特性的小人将不再受到奥术诅咒。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Arcane curse is a byproduct of the cursed trait. The cursed pawn is constantly affected by arcane weakness that will gradually increase until it is a persistent illness. The effects of the curse can be offset by using magic, however, the pain caused by the curse does provide a unique clarity. The curse can be lifted by removing the pawn's magical trait.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Arcane curse is a byproduct of the cursed trait. The cursed pawn is constantly affected by arcane weakness that will gradually increase until it is a persistent illness. The effects of the curse can be offset by using magic, however, the pain caused by the curse does provide a unique clarity. The curse can be lifted by removing the pawn's magical trait.-->
  <TM_CursedHD.description>奥术诅咒是受诅咒者特性的产物。 被诅咒的人不断受到奥术弱点的影响，这种弱点会逐渐增加，直到它成为一种持续的疾病。 诅咒的效果可以通过使用魔法来抵消，然而，诅咒造成的痛苦确实提供了一个独特的意识加成。没有魔法特性的小人将不再受到奥术诅咒。</TM_CursedHD.description>
